    'Google Maps shows duplicate station names at this location and varying hours; verify the boarding point and service with the operator.': 'May magkakaparehong pangalan ng himpilan at magkakaibang oras sa Google Maps. Kumpirmahin sa operator ang tamang sakayan at biyahe.',
