    'Better San Fernando is an independent civic guide to city services, officials, barangays, budgets, and public records in San Fernando, La Union.': 'Malayang gabay sibiko ito tungkol sa serbisyo, opisyal, barangay, badyet, at pampublikong rekord ng San Fernando, La Union.',
