    'residents · Rank': 'agnanaed · Ranggo',
    'Population figures use the 2024 Census of Population. The punong barangay and council come from the city government’s published directory. SK chairperson names were previously entered from the DILG Barangay Information System, but its records request failed with a 502 error during the October 23, 2026 review. The local roster has 58 names; Puspus has no verified entry, and the rest could not be rechecked. Confirm SK names with DILG before relying on them. The next regular barangay and SK elections are scheduled for November 2028 under Republic Act No. 12326. Facilities are not yet published in a citywide dataset.': 'Manipud iti Census 2024 ti populasion. Manipud iti directory ti siudad ti Punong Barangay ken konseho. Saan a napasingked dagiti nagan ti SK: saan a simmungbat ti DILG records request idi Oktubre 23, 2026, ken 58 laeng ti adda iti listaan. Awan ti napasingked a nagan ti Puspus. Pirmaam dagiti nagan iti DILG. Nakaiskedyul ti sumaruno a regular nga eleksion ti barangay ken SK para Nobiembre 2028 iti babaen ti Republic Act No. 12326. Awan pay ti citywide dataset dagiti pasilidad.',
