    'City ordinances are enacted by the Sangguniang Panlungsod, reviewed under national law, and published by the city. Executive orders are issued by the City Mayor. Proposed ordinances remain drafts until the council acts.': 'Ipasa ti Sangguniang Panlungsod dagiti ordinansa sigun iti linteg ti nacion, ken ipablaak ti siudad. Ti alkalde ti mangipablaak kadagiti executive order. Draft pay laeng dagiti ordinansa agingga nga aramiden ti konseho ti desisionna.',
