    "Shares follow BLGF's regular-income categories. Large one-off national shares can make a city's percentage look unusual.": 'Suroten dagiti paset dagiti regular a kategoria ti kita ti BLGF. Mabalin a di kadawyan ti porsiento no dakkel ti maminsan a pondo ti nacion.',
    'FY2024 figures from the Bureau of Local Government Finance (BLGF) are preliminary and cover the city government on its operating basis. The regional table compares the nine cities of Ilocos Region.': 'Pauna dagiti bilang para FY2024 manipud iti Bureau of Local Government Finance (BLGF), ken maibatay iti operasyon ti gobierno ti siudad. Idilig ti rehional a tabla dagiti siam a siudad iti Rehion ti Ilocos.',
    'Looking for bids and contracts?': 'Agsapsapul ka kadagiti bidding ken kontrata?',
    'Procurement plans, bid results, and project status are in the procurement collection.': 'Adda dagiti plano ti procurement, resulta ti bidding, ken kasasaad dagiti proyekto iti panid ti procurement.',
    'The city’s top-line amounts and the BLGF ledger below are FY2024 figures and use different reporting bases. BLGF lists FY2025 quarterly reports, but no verified annual FY2025 row is included here. FY2026 budget and investment documents are linked above; source publication dates vary.': 'Para FY2024 dagiti buod a bilang ti siudad ken talaan ti BLGF, ngem naibatayda kadagiti naiduma a pamay-an. Adda quarterly report ti BLGF para FY2025 ngem awan pay ti napasingked a nagan ti entero a tawen ditoy. Naka-link iti ngato dagiti dokumento ti badyet ken panagipon para FY2026; agduduma dagiti petsa ti panagipablaak.',
