    'Confirm the city’s undated rental estimates with the provider before making a decision. Water and telecommunications prices are not listed in the city profile.': 'Pirmaam iti mangipapaabang dagiti pateg nga awan ti petsana sakbay a mangaramid iti desision. Awan dagiti pateg ti danum ken telecom iti profile ti siudad.',
