    'DPWH projects are matched by the city named in the project description; engineering-district boundaries mean some road projects may extend beyond the city. PhilGEPS records are awards, not payments, and use the city government’s registered organization name.': 'Naidilig dagiti proyekto ti DPWH iti siudad a naibaga iti deskripsion; mabalin a lumabas iti beddeng ti siudad dagiti dadduma a kalsada. Dagiti naited a kontrata ti rekord ti PhilGEPS, saan a bayad, ket us-usarenna ti rehistrado a nagan ti gobierno.',
