    'More budget, procurement, and accountability documents are published on the city’s Full Disclosure Policy page.': 'Adda ad-adu a dokumento ti badyet, procurement, ken panagpaneknek iti panid ti Full Disclosure Policy ti siudad.',
    'Open the disclosure portal': 'Lukatan ti disclosure portal',
    'The city currently lists 2026 invitations and notices. The local bid-results table contains the latest result records we found, from 2025; the DPWH and PhilGEPS snapshots cover 2016–2025. Source pages and dataset dates are linked above.': 'Adda listaan ti siudad para kadagiti awis ken pakdaar idi 2026. Manipud idi 2025 ti naudi a resulta ti bidding a nasarakami; saklaw dagiti datos ti DPWH ken PhilGEPS dagiti tawen 2016–2025. Naka-link iti ngato dagiti paggapuan ken petsa ti dataset.',
