    'City annual audit report, CY2024': 'Tawenen a report ti audit ti siudad, CY2024',
    'COA has published the city’s 2024 report; the local fiscal charts remain FY2024 city and BLGF figures with separate reporting bases.': 'Impablaak ti COA ti report ti siudad para idi 2024. Nadumaduma dagiti pagbatayan dagiti tsart ti siudad ken ti BLGF.',
    'Zonal values used as the base for taxes on the sale, transfer, or lease of real property, organized by revenue district.': 'Dagiti zonal value a pagbasaran iti buis ti panaglako, panangiyalis, wenno panangpaupang iti daga, a naurnos sigun iti revenue district.',
