    'Historical ordinances maintained by the Sangguniang Panlungsod.': 'Dagiti daan nga ordinansa a mataginayon ti Sangguniang Panlungsod.',
    'Institutionalizes the city’s Persons with Disability Code, setting out rights, programs, accessibility requirements, and the responsibilities of city offices.': 'Ipatungpal ti ordinansa ti Kodigo dagiti Tao nga Addaan iti Kapansanan, a mangilawlawag kadagiti kalintegan, programa, pagalagadan ti pannakaakses, ken pagrebbengan dagiti opisina.',
    'Amends the city’s anti-dengue ordinance and updates the composition and responsibilities of the Anti-Dengue Task Force.': 'Baliwan daytoy ti ordinansa kontra dengue ken i-update dagiti kameng ken trabaho ti Anti-Dengue Task Force.',
    'Amends the city’s Pakikiramay or burial assistance ordinance, which provides support to families in need after a death.': 'Baliwan daytoy ti ordinansa ti Pakikiramay, a mangipaay iti tulong kadagiti pamilia kalpasan ti ipapatay.',
    'Proposes amnesty on penalties, surcharges, and interests on delinquent real property taxes, including the Special Education Fund, idle land tax, and other special levy taxes.': 'Ibingay ti singa iti multa ken interes dagiti saan a nabayadan a buis ti sanikua, agraman ti Special Education Fund ken dadduma pay a buis.',
    'Enhances the Fire Auxiliary Brigades ordinance by adding provisions and amending sections 5 and 8 on brigades in barangays and vital institutions.': 'Inayon daytoy dagiti pagannurotan maipanggep kadagiti Fire Auxiliary Brigade iti barangay ken napateg nga institusion.',
    'Amends sections 3.B and 6.B of the city ordinance reintegrating persons deprived of liberty into society.': 'Baliwan dagiti paset ti ordinansa a mangtulong kadagiti napalubosan manipud pannakaibalud tapno makisubli iti komunidad.',
    'Amends Executive Order No. 40-2025, reconstituting the City Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Council and defining its composition, functions, and four thematic areas.': 'Baliwan ti EO 40-2025 tapno buoem manen ti konseho para iti panangimanehar iti peggad ken didigra, ken ilawlawagna dagiti kameng ken trabaho.',
    'Creates a technical working group to support the preparation of the city’s agriculture and fisheries modernization plan.': 'Mangbukel iti grupo a mangtulong iti panagsagana iti plano para iti pannakapabaro ti agrikultura ken panagkalap.',
    'Constitutes the City Local Poverty Reduction Action Committee and sets its membership and coordinating role.': 'Mangbukel iti komite a mangbabbaba iti kinapanglaw ken mangikeddeng kadagiti kameng ken trabahona.',
    'Creates the Local Infrastructure Audit Team to review city infrastructure projects.': 'Mangbukel iti grupo a mangsukimat kadagiti proyekto ti imprastraktura ti siudad.',
    'Reconstitutes the City Incident Management Team and defines its incident response responsibilities.': 'Buoem manen ti grupo ti siudad para iti panangimanehar kadagiti insidente ken ilawlawagna dagiti pagrebbenganna.',
    'Amends Executive Order No. 11-2025 to reconstitute the Technical Working Group and Joint Inspection and Compliance Monitoring Unit.': 'Baliwan ti EO 11-2025 tapno buoem manen ti technical working group ken grupo para iti inspeksion ken panangsukimat iti panangsurot.',
    'Reorganizes the City Scholarship Board of the City of San Fernando, La Union.': 'Urnosen manen ti Scholarship Board ti Siudad ti San Fernando, La Union.',
    'Amends the composition of the city’s Program on Awards and Incentives for Service Excellence (PRAISE) Committee.': 'Baliwan dagiti kameng ti komite ti PRAISE a mangted iti pammadayaw ken insentibo para iti nasayaat a serbisio.',
    'Pindangan and San Fernando': 'Pindangan ken San Fernando',
    'Capital of La Union': 'Kapital ti La Union',
    'Juan de Salcedo reached the Ilocos coast and demanded tribute from the communities that would become San Fernando. The first Ilocano resistance was remembered in the name Darigayos, "where blood flowed."': 'Nadanon ni Juan de Salcedo ti baybay ti Ilocos ket nagkiddaw iti tributo kadagiti umili a nagbalin a San Fernando. Naipalagip ti panagkedked dagiti Ilokano iti nagan a Darigayos, “sadinno a nagayus ti dara.”',
    'San Guillermo de Dalangdang and San Vicente de Balanac were threatened by headhunting raids and Moro pirates. An Augustinian priest, Fr. Jose Torres, urged the survivors to settle together for protection.': 'Nakaam-amesan ti San Guillermo de Dalangdang dagiti panagramsak, ken ti San Vicente de Balanac dagiti pirata a Moro. Kinombinsir ni padi nga Agustino, Fr. Jose Torres, dagiti nakalibas a makipagtaeng tapno natalgedda.',
    'The merged settlements became Pindangan, a place for drying fish. On May 6, 1786, Fr. Fernando Rey founded Ministerio de San Fernando in honor of King Ferdinand of Spain.': 'Nagtipon dagiti ili a nagbalin a Pindangan, a lugar a pagiladan ti ikan. Idi Mayo 6, 1786, impasdek ni Fr. Fernando Rey ti Ministerio de San Fernando a maidayaw ken Ari Ferdinand ti Espanya.',
    'San Fernando was declared the cabecera, or capital, of the newly organized Province of La Union.': 'Naikeddeng a cabecera wenno kapital ti kabarbaro a Probinsia ti La Union ti San Fernando.',
    'Republic Act 8509 was signed on February 13, 1998. Residents ratified it in a plebiscite on March 20, 1998, converting the municipality into a component city.': 'Pinirmaan ti Republic Act 8509 idi Pebrero 13, 1998. Pinasingkedan dagiti umili babaen iti plebisito idi Marso 20, ket nagbalin a component city ti munisipalidad.',
