    'The named list combines a 2024 accommodation inventory and current map results, but does not represent all 129 establishments. Map results may include nearby municipalities; verify location, current operation and availability before booking.': 'Pinagtipon daytoy ti listaan ti paggianan idi 2024 ken dagiti agdama a resulta ti mapa; saan a kompleto dagiti 129 a lugar. Mabalin a mairaman dagiti asideg a ili, isu a paneknekan ti lokasion ken kaadda sakbay a mag-book.',
