    'Better San Fernando is an independent civic guide to city services, officials, barangays, budgets, and public records in San Fernando, La Union.': 'Naisina a giya para iti serbisio, opisial, barangay, badyet ken rekord publiko ti San Fernando, La Union daytoy.',
    'How Better San Fernando approaches keyboard access, screen readers, reduced motion, contrast, and accessible public documents.': 'Kitaen no kasano a sinuportaran ti Better San Fernando ti keyboard ken screen reader, nabassit a galaw, nalawag a contrast ken dokumento a maakses.',
